      "tr": "`return round(len(first & second) / len(union), 3)`.",
      "en": "`return round(len(first & second) / len(union), 3)`."
    },
    {
      "tr": "Çözümün tamamı:\n\n```python\ndef build_graph(edges):\n    graph = {}\n    for a, b in edges:\n        graph.setdefault(a, set()).add(b)\n        graph.setdefault(b, set()).add(a)\n    return graph\n\n\ndef jaccard(edges, a, b):\n    graph = build_graph(edges)\n    first, second = graph.get(a, set()), graph.get(b, set())\n    union = first | second\n    if not union:\n        return 0.0\n    return round(len(first & second) / len(union), 3)\n\n\nedges = [[\"ada\", \"bora\"], [\"ada\", \"cem\"], [\"bora\", \"cem\"], [\"bora\", \"deniz\"],\n         [\"cem\", \"deniz\"], [\"deniz\", \"ece\"], [\"ece\", \"fuat\"]]\nprint(jaccard(edges, \"ada\", \"deniz\"))\nprint(jaccard(edges, \"bora\", \"cem\"))\nprint(jaccard(edges, \"ada\", \"fuat\"))\n```",
      "en": "The full solution:\n\n```python\ndef build_graph(edges):\n    graph = {}\n    for a, b in edges:\n        graph.setdefault(a, set()).add(b)\n        graph.setdefault(b, set()).add(a)\n    return graph\n\n\ndef jaccard(edges, a, b):\n    graph = build_graph(edges)\n    first, second = graph.get(a, set()), graph.get(b, set())\n    union = first | second\n    if not union:\n        return 0.0\n    return round(len(first & second) / len(union), 3)\n\n\nedges = [[\"ada\", \"bora\"], [\"ada\", \"cem\"], [\"bora\", \"cem\"], [\"bora\", \"deniz\"],\n         [\"cem\", \"deniz\"], [\"deniz\", \"ece\"], [\"ece\", \"fuat\"]]\nprint(jaccard(edges, \"ada\", \"deniz\"))\nprint(jaccard(edges, \"bora\", \"cem\"))\nprint(jaccard(edges, \"ada\", \"fuat\"))\n```"
    }
